{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"13336139","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13336139","key":"KAFKA-10619","fields":{"summary":"Enable producer idempotence by default (KIP-679)","resolutiondate":"2021-07-08T05:56:13.664+0000","created":"2020-10-19T20:24:34.326+0000","description":"This is an after-work for KIP-185. \r\n\r\nIn the producer config,\r\n # the default value of `acks` will change to `all`\r\n # `enable.idempotence` will change to `true`\r\n\r\n[An analysis of the impact of max.in.flight.requests.per.connection and acks on Producer performance|https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/An+analysis+of+the+impact+of+max.in.flight.requests.per.connection+and+acks+on+Producer+performance] indicates that changing `acks` from `1` to `all` won't increase the latency and decrease the throughput in a significant way.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nKIP: https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-679%3A+Producer+will+enable+the+strongest+delivery+guarantee+by+default","issuelinks":[{"id":"12633518","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issueLink/12633518","type":{"id":"10030","name":"Reference","inward":"is related to","outward":"relates to","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issueLinkType/10030"},"outwardIssue":{"id":"13423209","key":"KAFKA-13598","self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13423209","fields":{"summary":"idempotence producer is not enabled by default if not set explicitly","status":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/status/5","description":"A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png","name":"Resolved","id":"5","statusCategory":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/statuscategory/3","id":3,"key":"done","colorName":"green","name":"Done"}},"priority":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/priorities/major.svg","name":"Major","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issuetype/1","id":"1","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product.","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=21133&avatarType=issuetype","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":21133}}}}],"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13336139/comment/17291284","id":"17291284","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=vvcephei","name":"vvcephei","key":"vvcephei","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726"},"displayName":"John Roesler","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Chicago"},"body":"Hey [~d8tltanc] , I noticed in your PR that you intended to wait until 3.0 for this. I'll go ahead and remove your KIP from the 2.8.0 release plan.\r\n\r\nFYI, it looks like the next release will be 3.0, so you should be clear to merge to trunk if you desire.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\n-John","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=vvcephei","name":"vvcephei","key":"vvcephei","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726"},"displayName":"John Roesler","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Chicago"},"created":"2021-02-25T23:01:53.838+0000","updated":"2021-02-25T23:01:53.838+0000"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13336139/comment/17329915","id":"17329915","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=soumyajitsahu","name":"soumyajitsahu","key":"soumyajitsahu","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Soumyajit Sahu","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"body":"Hi [~d8tltanc] ,\r\n\r\nI would like to raise an issue with making enable.idempotence=true by default.\r\n\r\nRecently, we hit an issue where a producer app of ours was using enable.idempotence=true, but was creating a producer object for each message.\r\n\r\nWe ended up in having thousands of producer ids for our log segment, and the broker crashed with OutOfMemory exception while trying to take a snapshot.\r\n\r\n I am not aware of any way to monitor this or check on such behavior. Hence, setting this to true could break many clusters with a surprise.\r\n\r\n It would be ideal to come up with a monitoring or controlling mechanism for this before we set it to true by default.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=soumyajitsahu","name":"soumyajitsahu","key":"soumyajitsahu","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Soumyajit Sahu","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"created":"2021-04-23T01:19:08.226+0000","updated":"2021-04-23T17:47:05.465+0000"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13336139/comment/17377086","id":"17377086","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=kkonstantine","name":"kkonstantine","key":"kkonstantine","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Konstantine Karantasis","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"body":"The [PR|https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/9497] has been merged and will be included with AK 3.0","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=kkonstantine","name":"kkonstantine","key":"kkonstantine","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Konstantine Karantasis","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"created":"2021-07-08T05:56:13.736+0000","updated":"2021-07-08T05:56:13.736+0000"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13336139/comment/17492047","id":"17492047","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ijuma","name":"ijuma","key":"ijuma","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Ismael Juma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"body":"See KAFKA-13598 for details on a bug that prevented part of this change from being applied in 3.0.0/3.1.0.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ijuma","name":"ijuma","key":"ijuma","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Ismael Juma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"created":"2022-02-14T15:08:06.396+0000","updated":"2022-02-14T15:08:06.396+0000"}],"maxResults":4,"total":4,"startAt":0},"status":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/status/5","description":"A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png","name":"Resolved","id":"5","statusCategory":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/statuscategory/3","id":3,"key":"done","colorName":"green","name":"Done"}}},"renderedFields":{"summary":null,"resolutiondate":"08/Jul/21 05:56","created":"19/Oct/20 20:24","description":"<p>This is an after-work for KIP-185. </p>\n\n<p>In the producer config,</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>the default value of `acks` will change to `all`</li>\n\t<li>`enable.idempotence` will change to `true`</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/An+analysis+of+the+impact+of+max.in.flight.requests.per.connection+and+acks+on+Producer+performance\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">An analysis of the impact of max.in.flight.requests.per.connection and acks on Producer performance</a> indicates that changing `acks` from `1` to `all` won't increase the latency and decrease the throughput in a significant way.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>KIP: <a href=\"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-679%3A+Producer+will+enable+the+strongest+delivery+guarantee+by+default\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-679%3A+Producer+will+enable+the+strongest+delivery+guarantee+by+default</a></p>","issuelinks":null,"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13336139/comment/17291284","id":"17291284","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=vvcephei","name":"vvcephei","key":"vvcephei","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726"},"displayName":"John Roesler","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Chicago"},"body":"<p>Hey <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=d8tltanc\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"d8tltanc\">d8tltanc</a> , I noticed in your PR that you intended to wait until 3.0 for this. I'll go ahead and remove your KIP from the 2.8.0 release plan.</p>\n\n<p>FYI, it looks like the next release will be 3.0, so you should be clear to merge to trunk if you desire.</p>\n\n<p>Thanks,</p>\n\n<p>-John</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=vvcephei","name":"vvcephei","key":"vvcephei","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=vvcephei&avatarId=34726"},"displayName":"John Roesler","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Chicago"},"created":"25/Feb/21 23:01","updated":"25/Feb/21 23:01"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13336139/comment/17329915","id":"17329915","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=soumyajitsahu","name":"soumyajitsahu","key":"soumyajitsahu","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Soumyajit Sahu","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"body":"<p>Hi <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=d8tltanc\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"d8tltanc\">d8tltanc</a> ,</p>\n\n<p>I would like to raise an issue with making enable.idempotence=true by default.</p>\n\n<p>Recently, we hit an issue where a producer app of ours was using enable.idempotence=true, but was creating a producer object for each message.</p>\n\n<p>We ended up in having thousands of producer ids for our log segment, and the broker crashed with OutOfMemory exception while trying to take a snapshot.</p>\n\n<p> I am not aware of any way to monitor this or check on such behavior. Hence, setting this to true could break many clusters with a surprise.</p>\n\n<p> It would be ideal to come up with a monitoring or controlling mechanism for this before we set it to true by default.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=soumyajitsahu","name":"soumyajitsahu","key":"soumyajitsahu","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Soumyajit Sahu","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"created":"23/Apr/21 01:19","updated":"23/Apr/21 17:47"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13336139/comment/17377086","id":"17377086","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=kkonstantine","name":"kkonstantine","key":"kkonstantine","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Konstantine Karantasis","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"body":"<p>The <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/9497\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">PR</a> has been merged and will be included with AK 3.0</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=kkonstantine","name":"kkonstantine","key":"kkonstantine","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Konstantine Karantasis","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"created":"08/Jul/21 05:56","updated":"08/Jul/21 05:56"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13336139/comment/17492047","id":"17492047","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ijuma","name":"ijuma","key":"ijuma","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Ismael Juma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"body":"<p>See <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-13598\" title=\"idempotence producer is not enabled by default if not set explicitly\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"KAFKA-13598\"><del>KAFKA-13598</del></a> for details on a bug that prevented part of this change from being applied in 3.0.0/3.1.0.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ijuma","name":"ijuma","key":"ijuma","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Ismael Juma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"created":"14/Feb/22 15:08","updated":"14/Feb/22 15:08"}],"maxResults":4,"total":4,"startAt":0},"status":null}}